%% Approval Sequence Diagram
%% Traces to: docs/02-solution-design/LLD/class-and-interface-design.md, LLD/version-management.md

%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': {'primaryColor':'#eef2f7','primaryBorderColor':'#0b2340','primaryTextColor':'#0b2340','lineColor':'#0b2340','secondaryColor':'#dde6f0','tertiaryColor':'#ffffff','fontFamily':'Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif','actorFontSize':'15px','noteFontSize':'14px','messageFontSize':'14px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Reviewer
    participant UC as ReviewCampaign
    participant Auth as AuthProvider
    participant Repo as CampaignRepository
    participant Agg as Campaign
    participant Audit as AuditLogRepository
    participant Events as Event Bus

    Reviewer->>UC: approve(versionBeingReviewed=2)
    UC->>Auth: currentUser()
    Auth-->>UC: Reviewer identity
    UC->>Repo: load(campaignId)
    Repo-->>UC: Campaign(currentVersion=2)
    UC->>Agg: approve(reviewerId, 2)
    Agg->>Agg: check state, version, self-review
    Agg-->>UC: Campaign(state=approved)
    UC->>Repo: save(campaign, expectedVersion=2)
    Repo-->>UC: Ok
    UC->>Audit: append(AuditEntry: approved)
    UC->>Events: emit(CampaignApproved)
    UC-->>Reviewer: Ok(Campaign)
    Events-->>Events: notify (async, best-effort, NFR-005)
